    `caused by events in the covered period` IS FALSE
    `incurred in the service of the ship` IS TRUE
    `due to wilful misconduct` IS TRUE
    `existed at signing and was deliberately concealed` IS FALSE

`a concealed heart condition` MEANS Harm WITH
    `first occurred in the covered period` IS TRUE
    `caused by events in the covered period` IS FALSE
    `incurred in the service of the ship` IS TRUE
    `due to wilful misconduct` IS FALSE
